#question(title: [Fire])[
  You hear a scream. You turn around and you
  see Alfonso is on fire. Literally! Luckily,
  you are next to a straight river. Alfonso
  is 10 meters away from the river and you
  are 5 meters away from the point $P$ on the
  river closest to Alfonso. You are carrying
  an empty bucket. You can run twice as fast
  with an empty bucket as you can run with a
  full bucket. How far from the point P
  should you fill your bucket in order to get
  to Alfonso with a bucket full of water as
  fast as possible?
]
